    "consequence": "With scaling, the returned pair need not retain ammo_time/reload_time=ammo_percent; sufficiently fast reload_time can become smaller than the unscaled ammo_time.",
    "w65Intent": "User-directed authored ratio at captured server duration, including Outlaw, intentionally does not replicate this apparent upstream inconsistency."
